{"chunk_id": "/Users/anwarh/Desktop/IBM/Automation/Agent/work_knowledge_agent/data/raw/work_IBM/main-EST-Users-Guide/EST-User-Guide-main/Automation/LinuxOnZ/LinuxNetworkTestSuite/perfinator.md::chunk-0006-2f8e3e885b5d5074", "source_file": "/Users/anwarh/Desktop/IBM/Automation/Agent/work_knowledge_agent/data/raw/work_IBM/main-EST-Users-Guide/EST-User-Guide-main/Automation/LinuxOnZ/LinuxNetworkTestSuite/perfinator.md", "section_heading": "Command-Line Options", "project": "work_knowledge_agent", "machine": "unknown", "component": "unknown", "mode": "unknown", "doc_type": "readme", "date": "2026-07-04", "owner": "unknown", "tags": ["ingested", "md"], "confidentiality_level": "internal", "extracted_commands": [], "extracted_errors": ["| `--on_error` | Options = `abort\\|continue` Action to take on device configuration error, default=`abort`. If `continue`, the Perfinator will continue to configure remaining interfaces and attempt to test without the failed interfaces. If `abort` the Perfinator will log the error and exit at the first failed interface. |"], "doc_type_confidence": 0.9, "section_heading_confidence": 0.9, "metadata_confidence": 0.9, "provenance": {"loader_version": "2.0.0", "chunker_version": "2.0.0", "extractor_version": "2.0.0", "ingested_at": "2026-07-04T02:09:57.553272+00:00", "content_hash": "dc294f78d1276430cd39abbb50d007cc388a4a6c837578cb7f82bda650d20f38", "loader_route": ".md"}}
