{"chunk_id": "/Users/anwarh/Desktop/IBM/Automation/Agent/work_knowledge_agent/data/raw/work_IBM/main-EST-Users-Guide/EST-User-Guide-main/Automation/ZoweLab/Tools/HCD Tools/Rebuild_IODFs.md::chunk-0000-0d17264c6aafed0e", "source_file": "/Users/anwarh/Desktop/IBM/Automation/Agent/work_knowledge_agent/data/raw/work_IBM/main-EST-Users-Guide/EST-User-Guide-main/Automation/ZoweLab/Tools/HCD Tools/Rebuild_IODFs.md", "section_heading": "Rebuild IODF's", "project": "work_knowledge_agent", "machine": "unknown", "component": "unknown", "mode": "unknown", "doc_type": "readme", "date": "2026-07-04", "owner": "unknown", "tags": ["ingested", "md"], "confidentiality_level": "internal", "extracted_commands": [], "extracted_errors": [], "doc_type_confidence": 0.9, "section_heading_confidence": 0.9, "metadata_confidence": 0.9, "provenance": {"loader_version": "2.0.0", "chunker_version": "2.0.0", "extractor_version": "2.0.0", "ingested_at": "2026-07-04T02:09:57.813247+00:00", "content_hash": "a040c63fb6b97d3165aafe7a1e4016035f9fc9ce75ae5c48b0bbb4d950c60001", "loader_route": ".md"}}
{"chunk_id": "/Users/anwarh/Desktop/IBM/Automation/Agent/work_knowledge_agent/data/raw/work_IBM/main-EST-Users-Guide/EST-User-Guide-main/Automation/ZoweLab/Tools/HCD Tools/Rebuild_IODFs.md::chunk-0001-ba62288b6a4c3e40", "source_file": "/Users/anwarh/Desktop/IBM/Automation/Agent/work_knowledge_agent/data/raw/work_IBM/main-EST-Users-Guide/EST-User-Guide-main/Automation/ZoweLab/Tools/HCD Tools/Rebuild_IODFs.md", "section_heading": "Purpose", "project": "work_knowledge_agent", "machine": "unknown", "component": "unknown", "mode": "unknown", "doc_type": "readme", "date": "2026-07-04", "owner": "unknown", "tags": ["ingested", "md"], "confidentiality_level": "internal", "extracted_commands": [], "extracted_errors": ["This automation generates IOCP statements from all the processors in an IODF, extracting them all from HCD and putting them in a file in `ZoweLab/HCD_Dynamic/IODF_Migration_Testing/filename`. These can be saved for later use, and were uploaded to Github from test runs, see the [tf_iodf repository](https://github.ibm.com/systemz/tf_iodf_repo).  This data is then migrated back into a new WORK IODF that is specified. The work IODF is then pushed into a production IODF, and the original production IODF and new production IODF are compared using the [HCD IODF Compare](./HCD%20IODF%20Compare.md) job. If errors are found in the migration or the comparison, error files are generated in `ZoweLab/HCD_Dynamic/IODF_Migration_Error_Logs/`. These error files include the HCD MSGLOG, LISTING file and IOCP Assembly output."], "doc_type_confidence": 0.9, "section_heading_confidence": 0.9, "metadata_confidence": 0.9, "provenance": {"loader_version": "2.0.0", "chunker_version": "2.0.0", "extractor_version": "2.0.0", "ingested_at": "2026-07-04T02:09:57.813303+00:00", "content_hash": "a040c63fb6b97d3165aafe7a1e4016035f9fc9ce75ae5c48b0bbb4d950c60001", "loader_route": ".md"}}
{"chunk_id": "/Users/anwarh/Desktop/IBM/Automation/Agent/work_knowledge_agent/data/raw/work_IBM/main-EST-Users-Guide/EST-User-Guide-main/Automation/ZoweLab/Tools/HCD Tools/Rebuild_IODFs.md::chunk-0002-1e9d0a331f9856ac", "source_file": "/Users/anwarh/Desktop/IBM/Automation/Agent/work_knowledge_agent/data/raw/work_IBM/main-EST-Users-Guide/EST-User-Guide-main/Automation/ZoweLab/Tools/HCD Tools/Rebuild_IODFs.md", "section_heading": "untitled-section", "project": "work_knowledge_agent", "machine": "unknown", "component": "unknown", "mode": "unknown", "doc_type": "readme", "date": "2026-07-04", "owner": "unknown", "tags": ["ingested", "md"], "confidentiality_level": "internal", "extracted_commands": [], "extracted_errors": ["es are generated in `ZoweLab/HCD_Dynamic/IODF_Migration_Error_Logs/`. These error files include the HCD MSGLOG, LISTING file and IOCP Assembly output.", "Known bug when importing certain stand-alone coupling facilities with mixed STP and CF channels as defined by HCD. It reports a CC 0008 on the job (generating an error log) and HCD doesn't migrate relevant statements. This has been brought to the attention of development."], "doc_type_confidence": 0.9, "section_heading_confidence": 0.3, "metadata_confidence": 0.3, "provenance": {"loader_version": "2.0.0", "chunker_version": "2.0.0", "extractor_version": "2.0.0", "ingested_at": "2026-07-04T02:09:57.813345+00:00", "content_hash": "a040c63fb6b97d3165aafe7a1e4016035f9fc9ce75ae5c48b0bbb4d950c60001", "loader_route": ".md"}, "metadata_validation_flags": ["metadata_confidence_below_threshold", "missing_section_heading"]}
